---
/* Hero. LAB-3 (consulting copy) changes the CTA buttons and adds a line under them. */
---
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <img class="hero-logo" src="/assets/ai-laboratory-mark.png" alt="AI Laboratory">
    <div class="hero-name">Daniel Stroup</div>
    <h1>From concept to delivery, <span class="glow">executed as intended.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-context">A published novel, an autonomous robot, a forensic financial audit, and more — each built solo with AI, in a field I'd never worked in before, start to finish.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#work">View the Work <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#contact">Request a Consultation <span class="arr">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
